! The Low Delos Mouth

''Stratum:'' below the constellation · ''Scale:'' Destination (megadungeon; Areas nest beneath).

Where ''Rinia rose from its bed'', the exposed crater opens a megadungeon piercing deep into the
Underdark — ''stabilized towns down to the third level'', lift-ports joining them to the sky.
The crater-glow brightens and dims on a nineteen-minute cycle that correlates with nothing and
has outlasted four scholarly careers. Scavenger-tier salvage economy; Path-Lares maintain the
Underdark maps; among the deepest, most stable Nexus-to-Underdark routes known.

''Live rumors:'' a "soulbound lash" said to hold Rakshasa's anger, unearthed by scavengers · a
newly opened sublevel wanting mapping.

''Open prompts:'' the three town-levels' names and trades · who holds the lift-gates at the
bottom · what the nineteen-minute cycle breathes FOR.

